      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَدِرٌ</span></b>  (S, A, Msb, K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَدْرٌ</span></b>  (S, K) and
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَدِيرٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَكْدَرُ</span></b>  (K) <i>Turbid; thick; muddy:</i>
(S, A, Msb, K) applied to water. (S, A, Msb.) ＝ 
 
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَيْشٌ كَدِرٌ</span>, and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَكْدَرُ</span></b>  (tropical:)  [<i>Life that is
